# Meta Suite: Meta AI, Facebook, Messenger, Instagram, Threads, WhatsApp and Quest
# Includes Meta AI domains; place MetaAI.list first when using a separate AI policy
# Curated service / CDN domains, not a complete list of Meta-owned domains or IPs
# Shared domains cannot separate in-app AI requests from ordinary social traffic
# Updated: 2026-10-16
# Research and limitations: ../../../docs/Meta.md (repository root)
# Community source snapshots:
# https://github.com/v2fly/domain-list-community/tree/c6adacf29cc4fb05e04651fcf03e00989ef9f797/data
# https://github.com/MetaCubeX/meta-rules-dat/blob/83c8208bdfae92b1caaa29745f51f233b6f1847e/geo/geosite/meta.list
# https://github.com/blackmatrix7/ios_rule_script/tree/19c84682407580056d0ae2f27e406f70db679de1/rule/Surge

# > Meta accounts / corporate sites / community
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,meta.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,atmeta.com

# > Meta AI / Model API / Llama / Muse (see MetaAI.list for individual sources)
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,meta.ai
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,llama.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,muse.ai
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,metaaivm.com

# > Shared Meta privacy transport, configured by the Muse public web bundle
# Exact hosts only; do not match the entire Fastly service
# Sources and limits: ../../../docs/Meta-2026-10-16.md
DOMAIN,meta-ohttp-config-prod.fastly-edge.com
DOMAIN,meta-ohttp-relay-prod.fastly-edge.com

# > Facebook and short links
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,facebook.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,facebook.net
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,fb.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,fb.me
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,fb.gg
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,fb.watch
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,fbwat.ch

# > Shared static resources / media / attachments / network infrastructure
# static.xx.fbcdn.net is also referenced by the public auth.meta.com login page
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,fbcdn.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,fbcdn.net
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,fbsbx.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,fbsbx.net
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,tfbnw.net
# Match this Facebook-specific Akamai hostname only
DOMAIN,fbcdn-a.akamaihd.net

# > Messenger
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,messenger.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,fbmessenger.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,m.me

# > Instagram (also covers aistudio.instagram.com)
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,instagram.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,cdninstagram.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,ig.me
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,igcdn.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,igsonar.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,instagr.am

# > Threads: keep both the current domain and the legacy redirect
# https://about.fb.com/news/2025/04/new-features-threads-web-experience/
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,threads.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,threads.net

# > WhatsApp (graph.facebook.com is already covered by facebook.com)
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,whatsapp.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,whatsapp.net
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,whatsappbrand.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,wa.me

# > Quest / Oculus service and CDN domains
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,oculus.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,oculuscdn.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,oculusvr.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,ocul.us
